# Notes For AI Assistant

* Supabase Auth handles authentication.
* `profiles` stores app user data.
* Doctors are a subset of profiles.
* Keep all Supabase logic inside repositories/services.
* Never call Supabase directly from Flutter widgets.
* Use dynamic scheduling instead of pre-generated slots.
* Use RLS on every table.
* Public browsing should never expose paused or expired doctors.
